<item>
<title>Unlimited Ammunition All Weapons</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=14918</link>
<description>Trained for weapon by getting one pick up, then 2 of the same kind, then 3 of the same.  Found address V nearby is an address which contains the value of the weapon you are holding.  Set break on read from this address.  At this point in the game, a1 = the player number (you are number 0) v1 = the weapon value v0 = base address of current character.  Wrote a code routine which allows the player to cycle through all the weapons with the UP and DOWN buttons  Code also gives the player Unlimited Ammo for whatever weapon they are holding.</description>
<author>Xploder &lt;support@xploder.net&gt;</author>
